  "web/package.json declares @vue/cli-service and its plugins, but every script runs vite: Vue CLI is not used and is not counted",
  "UnoCSS is the CSS framework (through @unocss/vite in vite.config.js); sass is only a preprocessor",
  "testify is the only Go test framework, used by a few _test.go files; go.mod has no test scope",
  "the compose file starts only MySQL and Redis; PostgreSQL, Oracle, SQL Server, SQLite, MongoDB and the object stores (Qiniu, MinIO, Aliyun OSS, Tencent COS, Amazon S3, Cloudflare R2, Huawei OBS) are chosen by sections of server/config.yaml",
